WEBVTT

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:09.670
It's raining... What do we do?

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:11.580
Wanna find shelter then go home?

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:14.170
No. Let's run home.

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:15.790
But if we do that...

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:19.380
I heard that a see-through bra
is an advantage to a boyfriend-

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:20.630
Please think twice about that.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:22.750
Rain is great, huh?

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.000
Hey, stick closer to me.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.380
Oh my. Like this?

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:27.210
Yeah, that's great!

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:30.710
Oh, I have a folding umbrella.

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:31.380
Huh?

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:35.130
Let's get under it, Kosaka-san.

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:39.630
Um...

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:44.080
After I've prepared myself a little bit...

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:46.790
Why is THAT what you think twice about?

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.670
You don't like sharing an umbrella, huh?

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:55.000
I-I'm sorry.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:32.750
I wonder if she's okay.

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:38.290
From there, in the end,
we decided to run home from the rain...

00:02:40.790 --> 00:02:43.500
I hope she doesn't catch a cold...

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:45.880
Maybe I should at least send a text.

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:48.250
I feel someone looking at me...

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:51.000
Stare...

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.790
K-Kanata... You need something?

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:55.540
You noticed me!

00:02:57.790 --> 00:03:01.540
Of course you're well attuned
to your cute little sister's presence, huh?

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:03.960
Anyone would notice you in that situation.

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:06.330
But still...

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:08.290
You don't have to be embarrassed...

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:11.420
It's okay to just honestly say that you love me!

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:14.130
As always, where does this confidence come from?

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:15.790
I guess it can't be helped.

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:19.250
Today as well, I'll entertain
my sad and lonely Big Brother!

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:20.040
O-okay...

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:22.960
Then wanna hang out after I finish this reply?

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:24.040
Sure!

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:30.750
Sneak...

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:33.330
W-what?

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:36.670
I thought you'd get lonely being away from me.

00:03:36.670 --> 00:03:38.290
Thanks.

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:39.250
Also...

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:40.750
Who's 'Kosaka-san'?

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:42.380
H-hey!

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:43.920
Don't sneak a look at that!

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:45.170
It's okay!

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:47.330
It can't be your girlfriend or anything!

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.170
But it is my girlfriend...

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:57.080
Eh?

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:58.790
Crap...

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:01.540
So Kana isn't your number one?!

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:05.250
I tried to keep it a secret,
but since it seems to be going this way...

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:09.580
Right... My brother has matured.

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:11.880
Huh? You have nothing to say?

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:14.000
Perhaps...

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:17.170
Y-y-you thought that Kana would be jealous?

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:19.880
I-it was an unexpected love at first sight, huh?

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:21.960
She's really shaking!

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:26.380
You're free to at least
have a girlfriend, after all!

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:30.000
I mean, because Kana is still the cutest to you!

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:33.920
Oh my! We've all of a sudden come this close!

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:37.330
This is your big chance to show affection!

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:40.250
There, there. You're a good girl, Kanata.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:44.000
It's good that you're so obedient.

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:47.500
I have a hard time trying to please you, too.

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:52.170
It's a call from Kosaka-san.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:55.130
Huh... I guess you have to answer.

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:58.080
Kana will wait for you in her room.

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:00.210
We're really gonna hang out afterwards!

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:05.960
Kosaka-san? Thanks for calling.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:10.420
You didn't catch a cold from that?

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:12.710
Really? Then I'm glad.

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:14.580
Oh, I see.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:16.830
Something that big in one bite?

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:18.710
That's amazing, Kosaka-san...

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:20.420
S-seems like he's having fun...

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:23.830
Even though he has Kana.

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:28.380
Do they really... get along that well?

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:41.750
What are you doing, Kanata?

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:43.830
N-nothing really...

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:46.880
I was just taking a walk, is all!

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:54.040
S-so it's not like I was curious about Kosaka-san
and came here to scope her out!

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:56.460
You just said so yourself...

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.290
That's not what I mean!

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:01.670
Shi-chan! I came to meet Shi-chan!

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:04.580
She's in the Year 3 classrooms.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:08.130
So, so...! Um...

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:09.170
Shinozaki-san.

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:13.710
Good morning.

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:17.580
Wow... She's so pretty.

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:20.540
Kosaka-san, morning.

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.670
Th-this is her?!

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:26.080
Um... Who is this?

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:30.080
Oh, this is my sister, she's a year younger,
and her name is Kanata.

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:32.750
I see, you're Shinozaki's...

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:37.210
Nice to meet you. I am Akiho Kosaka.

00:06:37.210 --> 00:06:37.880
B...

00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:40.330
B-b-b...

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:41.080
"B-"?

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:45.000
Big Bro always shares his snacks with Kana!

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.380
What is this sudden rivalry?!

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:49.420
And he also shares his side dishes!

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:51.290
Huh? Siblings sharing?!

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:52.790
I'll just go ahead and say this...

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:54.130
She means the 'side dishes' at dinner...

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:56.750
Just yesterday, he caressed Kana!

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:57.580
Uh, that was...

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:02.580
And he always follows behind Kana!

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:04.170
"Follows behind"...?

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:06.670
Do you really not want to be
away from me that much?

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:08.880
Aren't you the one who told me to come here?

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:10.460
How's that?!

00:07:10.460 --> 00:07:12.630
You can't claim anything like that, can you?!

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:15.580
That's right... I can't!

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:20.420
Pat, pat...

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:24.080
Okay, maintenance is done. Here I go.

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:33.130
I feel like there's some
awful misunderstanding going on.

00:07:33.330 --> 00:07:37.790
By the way, patting me on the head
is one of my big brother's daily chores!

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:39.170
Chore?!

00:07:39.170 --> 00:07:42.130
Kanata-san, you feel content
from that sort of action?

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:45.040
Well, I'd feel bad if I refused him.

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:47.630
H-how amazing!

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:50.210
This turn of events seems ominous somehow...

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:54.710
Oh dear, Kana has been so absorbed in this talk,
she's completely open to attack!

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:56.880
It can't be helped.

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:59.250
For now, I'll just pat her on the head
to make her quiet...

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:00.630
Please wait!

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:03.420
Committing forbidden relations
at school is unwise!

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:04.920
Wh-what are you saying?!

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:06.920
And there really was a
huge misunderstanding after all!

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.080
"Forbidden"?

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:11.710
Oh no, I want to be able to do it
without being embarrassed.

00:08:11.710 --> 00:08:14.960
Are you serious?!

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:19.830
For now, Kosaka-san's misunderstanding
has been resolved.

00:08:20.130 --> 00:08:23.210
I'm sorry... That was an awful misunderstanding...

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:26.250
It's okay. It isn't your fault...

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:27.500
However...

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:30.830
If you have a sister that cute,
the possibility of that is there.

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:32.880
No way! That's kind of extreme.

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:36.380
No... If it were me, from the viewpoint
of an older sister, maybe...

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:40.130
Huh? S-sisters?! Like, between girls?!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:43.290
Seems they're getting to be even closer!

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:47.040
Ta-da!

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:49.380
It's Super Kana-chan Time!

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:50.080
Kanata-san.

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:51.380
Super... what?

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:52.710
Basically...!

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:57.790
Today only, you've received the special privilege
of getting closer with Kana, Big Bro!

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:01.380
Th-that means... Kosaka-san can't join
since there would be three of us?

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:05.790
Jeez! You don't have to be embarrassed
to say that you want to be with just Kana!

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:07.580
Ouch...

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:09.210
Kosaka-san! Are you okay?!

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:11.210
Uh... um...

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:14.420
I sincerely apologize.

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:17.040
No, no! It isn't your fault.

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:18.830
Kanata was in the wrong...

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:21.040
I carelessly covered myself...

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:23.710
so I couldn't trigger the Lucky Pervert event.

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:25.000
What kind of apology is this?

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:30.080
Jeez! I have to really yell at her...

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:34.670
Big Bro...

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:40.330
Earlier... um... I thought that
you wanted to eat lunch with Kana, so...

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:42.880
But I was wrong...

00:09:43.830 --> 00:09:46.540
I'm sorry I caused you trouble.

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:48.960
It's okay.

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:52.790
Kosaka-san... I'm really, really sorry!

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:55.330
Please don't let it bother you.

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:56.710
On this end as well,

00:09:56.710 --> 00:10:00.170
I was given this special chance,
but I was unable to capitalize on it...

00:10:00.170 --> 00:10:00.830
Huh...?

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:02.170
You don't need to worry about that.

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:07.210
Let's start talking much more, Kanata-san.

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:11.380
Kosaka-san... Okay.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:14.670
Good. It seems like they're
getting familiar with each other.

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:20.210
Kana wants to be much,
much better friends with Kosaka-san!

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:23.670
Well then, it'd probably be good
if we all went out next time.

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:24.420
That's right!

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:27.750
Then I have to find a good cafe
or something somewhere!

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:32.170
Ah! This "Salon do Teakubi" looks super fancy!

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:32.790
Wow!

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:35.380
That's probably not a cafe...

00:10:42.170 --> 00:10:44.330
The "Campus-wide Clean-up Week" starts tomorrow.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:47.290
Let's all work together
and make the school beautiful.

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:48.880
Are you serious? Ugghhh...

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:51.460
This is a pain, honestly...

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:53.210
I understand your feelings.

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.460
However, let us make a choice!

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:59.500
It isn't that we are being made to do it,
but that we HAVE to do it!

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:00.710
Please recall...

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:04.170
That time you were lazy with cleaning,
and consequently...

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:07.250
your mother found your excite books!

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:11.420
Stand up, citizens!

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:16.500
For you will never forget that tragedy
besmeared with shame!

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:19.830
It had nothing to do with the clean-up week,

00:11:19.830 --> 00:11:21.960
but the boys were very inspired.

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:30.880
Shinozaki-san, please wait.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:32.000
Kosaka-san?

00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:35.710
We have to release all the gas from the spray can
before we can throw it away.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:37.920
Ah, I see...

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:41.580
Are there other things we should be careful about
before we throw them away?

00:11:41.580 --> 00:11:42.460
Let me see...

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:46.080
We should also release the air
inside a blow-up doll, I think.

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:48.750
I think you should be careful
to not throw that away here...

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:53.830
Ah, Sis. You have to release all the gas
from the spray can before throwing it away.

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:54.460
Oh really?

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:57.290
There's a method for throwing away this trash.

00:11:57.290 --> 00:11:59.380
Ah, I think I get it.

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:02.790
We have to throw it away
after it's all on the tissue, right?

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:06.920
There's so much coming out.

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:08.420
Sis, please get a clue.

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:11.330
Yay!

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:14.920
It's Witch Girl Magical Kana-chan!

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:18.710
Hey, Kanata. This is no time for play.

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:22.420
You thought I was like a little kid just now, right?

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:24.290
What's with that smug look?

00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:26.580
And if you get it, then stop it.

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:27.830
Too bad!

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:30.880
Kosaka-san told me that this is how adults play-

00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:31.750
All the more reason to stop!

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:34.670
Magical Girl Karikaru Shi-chan!

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:35.210
You stop too!

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:37.210
We're gonna punish you!

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:42.210
Did you already throw that other one away?

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:45.130
Well, I like new ones...

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:48.040
Is that also why you always
switch girlfriends so fast?

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:49.710
Shut up!

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:52.580
It's true, right? Pathetic!

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:57.540
Great work!

00:12:58.210 --> 00:12:59.880
I brought you a new bag.

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:03.540
A formal cleaning is good every once in a while...

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:05.630
Th-that's right...

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.380
I wonder if we'll clean the rooms today as well...

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:12.290
P-perhaps you'll throw away
some personal belongings?

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:15.040
Maybe... this is a good chance to.

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:20.500
Just kidding.

00:13:20.790 --> 00:13:22.420
I say it all the time,

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:24.080
but when you're attached to something,

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:26.630
you end up setting it apart
since you treasure it.

00:13:28.130 --> 00:13:29.330
Huh?

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:40.920
K..Kosaka-san?

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:44.880
Please continue... to treasure them.

00:13:45.210 --> 00:13:47.040
R-right...

00:13:47.170 --> 00:13:50.040
Does she have some sort of emotional attachment
to my personal belongings?

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:53.630
"Just whip it out now!"

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:56.000
...can I say that?

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:57.420
Here you go.

00:13:57.830 --> 00:13:59.670
I made you a lunch box.

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:02.130
Huzzah!

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:04.580
A homemade lunch box, made with the heart!

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:07.040
You can grasp your
boyfriend's heart with this too!

00:14:10.330 --> 00:14:12.880
A homemade... lunch box!

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:19.540
And that's why I attempted to make
a homemade lunch box by myself, but...

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:22.460
Huh? Kosaka-san's homemade lunch box?!

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:27.630
Do you want power?

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:29.380
Wh-what? What did you make?!

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:33.170
As your girlfriend... this is lethal, isn't it?

00:14:33.170 --> 00:14:35.130
What in the world is that?

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:36.830
Oh, there you are.

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:38.000
Sis.

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:42.040
Haru, Aki-chan. Let's have lunch together.

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:50.000
Great work today as well!

00:14:50.630 --> 00:14:53.880
Ariyama-senpai, is that, perhaps, homemade?

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:56.420
It ish!

00:14:57.670 --> 00:15:01.080
Cooking is your specialty, isn't it?

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:03.790
That's right!

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:08.630
I guess both food and men are my specialties...

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:09.960
Right...

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:11.580
Just as I thought...

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:14.460
Apprentice...

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:16.540
Please make me your apprentice!

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:17.290
Huh?

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:18.670
Ah, no...

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:20.960
Right now, I'm not really good at cooking for men... So...

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:24.580
Please! Please!

00:15:24.580 --> 00:15:28.130
Hey! S-stop...

00:15:28.130 --> 00:15:30.420
That unexpected reaction worries me...

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:32.290
Please let me call you 'Master'!

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:33.580
If you keep doing that...!

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:35.630
Make a pact!

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:37.500
And this is...

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:41.210
The Cooking Class In the Ariyama Household!

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:46.420
Let's make a delicious dinner!

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:47.830
Yes, Master!

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:51.000
Okay, first of all prepare your ingredients.

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:52.630
Understood!

00:15:54.170 --> 00:15:56.040
Ingredients for beef stew...

00:15:58.420 --> 00:16:00.080
Is this okay?

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:03.790
So very close. Here's the correct answer!

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:06.080
The position doesn't matter!

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:09.540
And this is how you use the knife...

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:10.540
A-a superhuman feat!

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:12.330
M-me too...

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:16.920
You don't have to strain.

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:20.670
When you're peeling the skin, do it nice and neat...

00:16:20.670 --> 00:16:23.210
And it's not good if the 'teeth' stick out too much.

00:16:23.380 --> 00:16:24.750
The blade, okay? The blade!

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:29.960
I... am still inexperienced...
I wonder if I can do it well?

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:33.750
It's okay, Haru also lacks experience...

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:35.960
Don't put any strange meaning into that!

00:16:36.380 --> 00:16:38.460
I-I won't mess up, right?

00:16:38.670 --> 00:16:40.380
It'll be okay if you are calm!

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:45.250
"I can do it, I can do it"...go ahead.

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:48.170
"I can do it, I can do it."

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:51.960
Self-suggestion, huh?
Putting it into words is probably good.

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:55.670
"I am lewd, I am lewd"...go.

00:16:55.670 --> 00:16:56.420
"I am le-"

00:16:56.420 --> 00:16:57.130
Not happening!

00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:00.580
Hey, hey, Haru...

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:04.750
When the meal is over,
let's do something fun in my room.

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:06.920
I want a taste of you too.

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:08.830
That sort of temptation is futile.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:10.250
What do you mean?

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:12.420
Because, Shinozaki-san...

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:15.500
can only be aroused when wearing
nothing but a nursery school cap.

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:17.580
He's a super loli-pedo creep!

00:17:17.960 --> 00:17:19.330
I wanna go to a social welfare college...

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:21.170
N-n-no way!

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:23.170
That's right!

00:17:23.170 --> 00:17:25.830
Now that you mention it,
he doesn't push away other females, right?

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:27.380
This is helpful.

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:29.250
I don't really care,

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:32.000
but could you do something besides
make fun of me while the food is boiling?

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:35.580
Crap, it's all jokes with them.

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:37.880
Can she really even cook?

00:17:38.880 --> 00:17:41.710
Aki-chan, it's gotten pretty melty now...

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:42.920
Yes.

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:47.500
It isn't bad for two girls
to do this together, right?

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:50.250
Ariyama-senpai,
your method of teaching is so good.

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:52.460
W-what are they doing?

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:54.580
They can't be...?!

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:56.290
It's your first time, right?

00:17:56.290 --> 00:17:59.290
You can leave it all to me.

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:00.170
O-okay...

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:05.580
We can put it in there soon...

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:07.540
I'm nervous!

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:13.880
Wh-wh-whaaaa?

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:18.130
Oh my, if Haru gets wind of this conversation,
he'll get moody.

00:18:18.130 --> 00:18:19.290
You're so loud!

00:18:20.630 --> 00:18:25.330
Alright! Aki-chan and Shi-chan's
Special Beef Stew is done!

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:26.580
Oh! Looks good!

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:28.540
I-I did it...

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:31.000
Yeah, yeah! You did well, Aki-chan!

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.960
Okay, let's eat it together!

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:37.000
You seem pretty happy...

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:41.040
Yup! It's been awhile since
I've had dinner with someone.

00:18:41.460 --> 00:18:45.210
That's right... Her parents always come home late.

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:47.460
She's really cheery.

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:48.880
Ready, and...

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:50.380
Let's eat!

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:57.000
Yum! This is really amazing, Kosaka-san!

00:18:57.500 --> 00:19:01.250
Great. I'm glad you said that.

00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:03.080
Of course it is.

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:05.290
After all, her master is good!

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:05.960
Ah!

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:09.040
I forgot to make the dessert for after we eat.

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:10.290
Dessert?

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:11.750
That will be easy to make.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:15.130
First we'll coat a peeled banana in yogurt,

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:17.630
and sandwich that in your chest and it's done!

00:19:17.630 --> 00:19:18.750
Shinozaki-san...

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:19.750
Stop that!

00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:21.330
Sorry, sorry!

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:25.670
But, I want to eat Haru's banana! You know?

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:26.250
Banana! Banana!

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:30.210
Now she's too cheery,
and more annoying than usual...

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:33.540
Fine, I'll let you eat it then.

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:34.710
Huh?

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:36.960
H-Haru... Seriously?!

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:38.630
I... I mean...

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:41.080
I didn't think that you'd go along with it...

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:42.500
and my mind is not prepared...

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:45.380
Okay, here's my banana.

00:19:48.380 --> 00:19:50.460
Don't eat it weird, okay?

00:19:55.830 --> 00:19:56.960
O-oh my...

00:19:57.250 --> 00:20:00.080
Thick bananas are... so yummy...

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:02.170
You're going to eat it like that?

00:20:02.170 --> 00:20:03.500
I wonder why...

00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:05.210
Has her wit disappeared all of a sudden?

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:09.920
After that, Sis ate three more bananas.

00:20:10.710 --> 00:20:12.710
Thank you for today.

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:15.170
Come hang out again, Aki-chan!

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:17.880
Okay, I'm going to walk Kosaka-san home.

00:20:23.670 --> 00:20:25.170
It's raining again...

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:28.790
It was right to bring a folding umbrella.

00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:31.460
Kosaka-san, you have an umbrella?

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:32.710
Huh?

00:20:34.630 --> 00:20:36.000
Um...

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:41.290
I forgot it. Let me under, please.

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:53.790
She still doesn't like sharing an umbrella...

00:20:58.920 --> 00:21:02.920
Um... You should move this way a bit more.
You're gonna get wet.

00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:05.290
Okay...

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:16.000
Oh. But to a boyfriend,
I heard it's good to get a little wet...

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:18.540
Oh no, it's fine.

00:22:58.710 --> 00:23:00.540
Here's the correct answer!

00:23:04.630 --> 00:23:08.170
Shinozaki-san, that looks like an 'exit only' door.

00:23:08.170 --> 00:23:11.420
Why do you know the entrance and exit doors
for an exciho?

00:23:12.580 --> 00:23:14.880
I'm gonna show you my ultra technique!

00:23:14.880 --> 00:23:16.380
Oh my!

00:23:16.630 --> 00:23:20.210
Encountering another couple is kinda awkward!

00:23:20.210 --> 00:23:21.540
I'll look away.

00:23:21.540 --> 00:23:24.000
Shinozaki-san, which room would you like?

00:23:24.000 --> 00:23:25.210
Kosaka-san!

00:23:25.210 --> 00:23:29.080
If I look closely your clothes
are see-through! I can't face you!

00:23:29.080 --> 00:23:32.500
Yeah! My ultra technique is seriously awesome!

00:23:32.960 --> 00:23:34.330
Shinozaki-san?

00:23:34.330 --> 00:23:37.380
What in the world should I be looking at?!
